WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:12.790
Mercury, number one.

2
00:00:12.791 --> 00:00:16.842
It is the closest to the sun.

3
00:00:16.843 --> 00:00:20.140
Venus bright, number two.

4
00:00:20.141 --> 00:00:24.998
Morning and evening star we view.

5
00:00:24.999 --> 00:00:28.255
Planet Earth, number three.

6
00:00:28.256 --> 00:00:32.604
We live on it, you and me.

7
00:00:32.605 --> 00:00:36.848
Planet Mars, number four.

8
00:00:36.849 --> 00:00:41.333
Named after the Roman god of war.

9
00:00:41.334 --> 00:00:44.595
Number five, Jupiter.

10
00:00:44.596 --> 00:00:49.382
Colored clouds around it stir.

11
00:00:49.383 --> 00:00:52.648
Number six, big Saturn.

12
00:00:52.649 --> 00:00:56.881
Many rings around it turn.

13
00:00:56.882 --> 00:01:00.224
Number seven, Uranus.

14
00:01:00.225 --> 00:01:03.910
It looks blue and green to us.

15
00:01:03.911 --> 00:01:07.089
Number eight, stormy Neptune.

16
00:01:07.090 --> 00:01:12.154
Triton is its frozen moon.

17
00:01:12.155 --> 00:01:14.895
The eight planets that we know.

18
00:01:14.896 --> 00:01:21.955
Round and round the sun they go.
